<title>FINLAND: FINNISH SISU PROPOSES NIL DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>FINNISH SISU PROPOSES NIL DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		     nil vs 1.00</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		   112 vs 219</p>
<p> Net sales					  5,760 vs 6,021</p>
<p> Operating profit				   247 vs 379</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish heavy vehicles maker is Sisu Oy.</p>
<p>Sisu and Finnish cargo handling equipment and building materials</p>
<p>group Partek Oy Ab have agreed to merge during 1997.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248, news@Reuters.fi</p>
